 "prompt": "This block swapper is broken: it does not do what it should. Repair it.\n\nGoal: The slot (0,0,0) holds the red concrete block while the lever is off and the blue concrete block while it is on; the two blocks swap every time the lever is flipped.\n\nSpec (checked in the game engine):\n- Lever at [-1, -1, 3]; it starts off. The grader settles the build, then flips the lever 6 times (idle gaps [0, 3, 7, 1, 11, 2] ticks before each flip).\n- After each flip the build must come to rest within 60 ticks, then stay unchanged for 40 ticks.\n- Lever off (start and after every even flip): (0, 0, 0) is red_concrete.\n- Lever on (after every odd flip): (0, 0, 0) is blue_concrete.\n- The whole build must return to exactly the same resting state every two flips; no item drops; no block may leave the box.\n- At most 33 blocks (lever included), all inside the box [-2, -4, -1]..[5, 1, 4].\n- Exactly 1 red_concrete, 1 blue_concrete in the build, at all times.\n\nYou may change, add or remove any blocks except the lever. Allowed blocks: the benchmark allow-list. Submit the complete build as a list of blocks.",
